# Quitting in Upcoming and starting again shows Upcoming with the same entry focused.
file <<END
- Alpha @due({today+1})
- Beta @due({today+2})
- Gamma @due({today+3})
END
keys gU j
see ▌ - Beta
restart
see Upcoming
see ▌ - Beta
keys x
quit
saved <<END
- Alpha @due({today+1})
- Beta @due({today+2}) @done({today})
- Gamma @due({today+3})
END
